      <activity id="2a68011d-078c-55a4-93ab-517781a3947c" activityNameId="4798c359-a292-5a70-a47d-f897475ff035" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Disposal, ventilated ceiling system, commercial kitchen</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal, ventilated ceiling system, commercial kitchen
Disposal of a ventilated ceiling system, commercial kitchen with 5'000-20'000 m3/h nominal air flow rate of the kitchen. Reference value of inventory is 1 m3/h air flow of the kitchen. Inventory is an average of 3 commercial kitchens with a total nominal air flow of  37670 m3/h, specific weight of the components: 0.2 kg/(m3/h). Exhaust and supply air ceiling system mainly made of stainless steel and aluminium. Stainless steel exhaust air hood for kitchen and/or dishwasher included. No ducts included.;
UUID: 327246ff-511a-4427-ad91-bff204285fbc
Transport to dismantling facilities, machines for handling in sorting plant, electricity demand for sorting plant, final disposal of waste material. Cut-off to recycling for metals.
Location: Specific to the technology mix encountered in sorting plants in Switzerland.
Technology: Disposal to a sorting plant assumed. Metal pieces, copper in cables and electronic devices are recycled, plastic parts are incinerated, inert wastes (e.g. rock wool) are landfilled.
Time period: Amount of material investigated in 2013. Disposal technology mix as used in late 1990ies
Production volume: na
Sampling: Waste-specific calculation based on production input data 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_327246ff-511a-4427-ad91-bff204285fbc.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
